      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAY SANDS (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (20.55) at this track behind Bailey Dutton in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. One of the leading chances. WHAT'S THE PRICE (7) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (20.50) at this track. Key runner on best form. MISS AMARI (1) goes very well this course and distance starting five times for two wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (22.51) when sixth over 390m at Q Lakeside in a P5. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. ANOTHER LEGEND (8) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
